  isBadDecision: 0
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Here is a man who will no longer have to hear the atrocities of these lands!
      What a lucky one! I envy his ability to be able to ignore all the crimes he
      has found here on earth!
  - speaker: 0
    text: This man is dead, you know? It might be the only thing left of him, by
      the way...
  - speaker: 1
    text: "On top of that, does he take the liberty of taking his leave from our
      reality?! And well ,traveler, he\u2019s probably the luckiest person I\u2019ve
      ever met! "
